Tool response:
Tool: deactivate_rate_plan_for_all_sites
Description: Deactivates the specified rate plan for all sites starting April 1, 2024.
This updates the site_rate_plans table to set is_active=0 for all entries 
matching the rate_plan_id where effective_from >= '2024-04-01'.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "rate_plan_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Rate Plan Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "rate_plan_id"
      ]
    }
